Place the converted auto-plot model here as `cephalometric.onnx`.
It is then copied to /models/cephalometric.onnx at build time (webpack.config.js
CopyPlugin) and fetched by src/predictors/onnx.ts (MODEL_URL).

Generate it with: python tools/convert_hrnet_to_onnx.py --out src/assets/models/cephalometric.onnx
(needs huggingface.co reachable). The .onnx itself is gitignored — see
.gitignore and docs/auto-plot-handoff.md for hosting options.
